# Python Network Security Monitoring Tool

## Overview

A beginner-friendly Python project for defensive network traffic analysis. It examines simulated network-flow records, identifies unusual traffic patterns, and generates a security monitoring report.

## Features

- Network connection summaries
- Traffic volume analysis
- Blocked connection tracking
- Repeated blocked connection alerts
- High traffic volume alerts
- Automated text report generation

## Technologies

- Python 3
- Kali Linux
- CSV

